WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.839 --> 00:00:03.831
(phone ringing)

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:09.125
(typing)

00:00:12.381 --> 00:00:16.137
(drizzling on roof)

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.943
(ominous music)

00:00:31.304 --> 00:00:33.881
- [Newscaster] Sunny,
with highs at about 76,

00:00:33.881 --> 00:00:35.785
you can take a look at the...

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:37.666
Excuse me...

00:00:37.666 --> 00:00:39.593
Are you sure?

00:00:39.593 --> 00:00:43.006
This just in, we might have rain.

00:00:43.006 --> 00:00:45.718
(gasps)

00:00:45.793 --> 00:00:47.743
Are you sure?

00:00:47.743 --> 00:00:50.506
Julia, I can't be wrong.

00:00:50.506 --> 00:00:53.762
Los Angeles will be experiencing
a quarter inch of rain.

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:55.341
(gasps)

00:00:55.341 --> 00:00:57.262
- That's so much.

00:00:59.241 --> 00:01:00.583
- It's happening.

00:01:03.792 --> 00:01:05.627
- So whip out your umbrellas, folks.

00:01:05.627 --> 00:01:07.814
This could be a rain of terror.

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:09.044
(suspenseful music)

00:01:09.044 --> 00:01:12.034
- We gotta go, we gotta go, we gotta go!

00:01:13.456 --> 00:01:15.337
- The dispensaries are going to close!

00:01:15.337 --> 00:01:16.962
- Guys, I've seen this before,

00:01:16.962 --> 00:01:20.393
just stay inside and we'll be okay.

00:01:22.047 --> 00:01:23.208
- I don't know how to use this thing!

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:23.990
- Make it open.

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:24.849
- Is there an on button?

00:01:24.849 --> 00:01:25.741
- Open it!

00:01:28.051 --> 00:01:30.426
- It's okay, Mr. Woofington, it's okay.

00:01:31.221 --> 00:01:33.868
- Drive much slower,
and sometimes pull over

00:01:33.868 --> 00:01:35.865
if it gets too scary.

00:01:35.865 --> 00:01:37.577
(screams)

00:01:37.908 --> 00:01:39.412
(gagging)

00:01:39.951 --> 00:01:41.757
(crying)

00:01:43.132 --> 00:01:45.031
(heavy breathing)

00:01:48.449 --> 00:01:53.232
- Guys, wait... the sun is coming out!

00:01:53.232 --> 00:01:56.135
(playful music)

00:01:56.135 --> 00:01:59.473
(laughter)

00:02:04.726 --> 00:02:07.274
- Wow, that was a crazy 11 seconds.

00:02:10.879 --> 00:02:13.149
(phones ringing)

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:19.279
(shaking)

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:21.490
- Did you just feel that?

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.533
- I think we just had an earthquake.

00:02:23.533 --> 00:02:24.462
- Oh.

00:02:24.462 --> 00:02:26.987
(laughter)

00:02:32.101 --> 00:02:35.021
- Does this mean the drought is over?

